<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Coronation gets 96.73 pct offer take-up.</title>
<headline>Coronation gets 96.73 pct offer take-up.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Coronation Holdings Ltd said on Friday that it had got subscriptions for 96.73 percent of the &quot;N&quot; ordinary shares in its rights offer.</p>
<p>The remaining shares are to be subscribed for by the underwriter to the offer.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
<p>johannesburg.newsroom@reuters.com</p>
